OL,3,GNEWSACarrie Johnson takes on rape      
OL,4,Acrisis charity role                    
OL,6,FCarrie Johnson has been appointed a    
OL,7,Frape crisis charity's first ambassador,
OL,8,Falmost 20 years after she was drugged  
OL,9,Fby black cab serial rapist John        
OL,10,FWorboys.                               
OL,12,FThe wife of former Prime Minister Boris
OL,13,FJohnson was 19 when she escaped Worboys
OL,14,Fand later gave evidence at his trial in
OL,15,F2009.                                  
OL,17,FHe is serving a life sentence for      
OL,18,Fsexual offences he committed by luring 
OL,19,Fwomen into his taxi late at night by   
OL,20,Fpretending to have won money and       
OL,21,Foffering drinks he had laced with      
OL,22,Fdrugs.                                 
