OL,3,GNEWSACarrie Johnson takes on rape      
OL,4,Acrisis charity role                    
OL,6,FJohnson said she was "incredibly proud"
OL,7,Fto represent Rape Crisis South London  
OL,8,F(RCSL), which offers counselling and   
OL,9,FIndependent Sexual Violence Adviser    
OL,10,F(ISVA) assistance for those considering
OL,11,Freporting their attack to police.      
